EVALUATION.md §8.3: a false one-line warn is W5001: in a record at the instance (a literal:
its `{`), at package level at the warn keyword.
-- teamboard/deck.canon --
package teamboard

record Deck {
  maxHidden: Int

  warn few: maxHidden < 3 else "maxHidden is high"
}

let deck: Deck = { maxHidden: 5 }

warn deck.maxHidden < 4 else "maxHidden above 3"
-- findings.txt --
warning[W5001]  teamboard/deck.canon:9:18
  deck: maxHidden is high
  expected by teamboard/deck.canon:6 (check few)

warning[W5001]  teamboard/deck.canon:11:1
  maxHidden above 3
  expected by teamboard/deck.canon:11 (check)

0 errors, 2 warnings in 1 package (…)
